PARITY — web SettingsExportImport.tsx → native (every t() + branch reproduced)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Header        : IconBox(Database→externaldrive) + "Backup & Restore" + subtitle.
Export row    : primary Button — idle "Export JSON"(download glyph) / "Exporting…"(spinner,
                disabled) → fetch + save → success toast ("Settings exported" / "Saved to your
                downloads folder."); offline + generic failure toasts (native classification of
                the web mutation toast).
Import row    : heading + helper + the stage machine, EVERY state rendered (no hidden surface):
                • idle      → dashed dropzone + "Drag a JSON bundle here, or" + "Choose a file"
                              (.fileImporter [.json]) + drag highlight (.dropDestination → web
                              dragActive).
                • parsing   → "Reading…" (spinner, disabled).
                • parseError→ too-large / read-fail / "File is not valid JSON: {detail}" /
                              the 8 validator messages / preview-failed — red inline box.
                • preview   → "Previewing {name} ({bytes})" + "{a} added, {u} updated, {s}
                              unchanged" + per-section diff (`+a ~u =s` / `—`) + Change file +
                              Cancel + Apply (3-way: "Apply N change(s)" / "Nothing to apply" /
                              "Applying…", disabled when applying or total==0).
                • applied   → "Import complete" + diff + Done.
                The apply step-up (RequireSudo) → `sudoCanceled` kept as a non-error that leaves
                the dry-run preview visible (web `SudoCanceledError`).
Toast         : model-held, tone-colored, dismissible, self-clearing (web `useToast`).
Section labels: General settings / Alert rules / Geofences / Quiet hours.
SI/units      : N/A — this surface carries no unit-suffixed values.

